			<item>
				<title>Who We Are</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/en/kdo-jsme/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/en/kdo-jsme/</guid>
				<description>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/babeta.jpg&#34;&#xA;  &#x9;&#x9;&#x9;alt=&#34;As the frontman, she takes care of the melody and energy of every song. Her musical roots include, among other achievements, reaching the finals of the national Mladá píseň competition.&#34;&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&#xA;  &#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;h4&gt;Babeta - lead vocals and piano&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;As the frontman, she takes care of the melody and energy of every song. Her musical roots include, among other achievements, reaching the finals of the national Mladá píseň competition.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &#x9;&#x9;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/mira.jpg&#34;&#xA;  &#x9;&#x9;&#x9;alt=&#34;His basslines are pleasantly smooth and melodic. This comes from a lifetime of playing the electric guitar—an instrument he mastered with such deep feeling that it earned him awards and an invitation to Michal Pavlíček’s renowned TV show, Na Kloboučku.&#34;&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&#xA;  &#x9;&#x9;&#x9;&lt;h4&gt;Míra - bass and electric guitar, backing vocals&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;His basslines are pleasantly smooth and melodic. This comes from a lifetime of playing the electric guitar—an instrument he mastered with such deep feeling that it earned him awards and an invitation to Michal Pavlíček’s renowned TV show, Na Kloboučku.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &#x9;&#x9;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/figure&gt;</description>
